==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Thanksgiving]] [[day|Day]]}}

# {{lb|en|Canada}} A [[holiday]], originally to give thanks to God for the harvest, celebrated annually on the second [[Monday]] of [[October]].
#: {{syn|en|Thanksgiving|}}
# {{lb|en|US}} A [[holiday]], originally to give thanks to God and to [[commemorate]] the [[feast]] held by the [[Pilgrim]] [[colonist]]s, celebrated annually on the fourth [[Thursday]] of [[November]].
#: {{syn|en|Thanksgiving|Turkey Day|T-Day}}

